s.sub.window.js., a=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328801\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/connection-allowlist/tentative/speculation_rules_prefetch.https.sub.window.js.ini"], "git_node": "c9fc813254ade34aba9f7ce3103173a8cc2a0181", "git_parents": ["c42ac8ad564832afa96d8a3483a7cedf2126b921"], "node": "7dcaa67b3167142458d47397dc06f82c3524447b", "parents": ["fa78b21dcbb817f017884bd8ca0e7aca7a1a8cbb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Watt \u003cjwatt@jwatt.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066027. Take animation-range into account for scroll-driven animations on the compositor. r=layout-scroll-driven-animation-reviewers,firefox-style-system-reviewers,boris, a=dsmith\n\nWPT used where possible, but some testing needed Mochitests.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323309\n", "files": ["dom/animation/ScrollTimeline.h", "gfx/layers/AnimationHelper.cpp", "gfx/layers/AnimationInfo.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/LayersMessages.ipdlh", "layout/style/test/file_animations_omta_scroll.html", "layout/style/test/file_animations_omta_scroll_rtl.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/scroll-animations/css/animation-range-smooth-scroll-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/scroll-animations/css/animation-range-smooth-scroll.html"], "git_node": "fa9843d1963da8b5cece54ca6f509d537977c129", "git_parents": ["c9fc813254ade34aba9f7ce3103173a8cc2a0181"], "node": "7594e3326b88fee3becc02149343953ffaf84529", "parents": ["7dcaa67b3167142458d47397dc06f82c3524447b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Delia Pop \u003cdpop@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075240 - Update/disable UI tests broken by the homepage redesign, a=dsmith\n\nThe homepage redesign (D326014) removed the stories carousel from the homepage and hides the wordmark on the private homepage. Several legacy UI tests still asserted the old elements and started failing.\n\nAreas affected:\n  - HomeScreenRobot.verifyPrivateBrowsingHomeScreenItems()\n  - HomeScreenTest.homeScreenItemsTest\n  - TabbedBrowsingTest.privateModeStaysAsDefaultAfterRestartTest and privateTabsDoNotPersistAfterClosingAppTest\n  - PocketTest (all tests)\n\nTry in progress:  https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try&revision=1ea06090740714dddf40e4ca66ab46c588859c61\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328895\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328945\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/HomeScreenTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/PocketTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/robots/HomeScreenRobot.kt"], "git_node": "49713b40ec21590e81f8dbd7275b874a340052f9", "git_parents": ["fa9843d1963da8b5cece54ca6f509d537977c129"], "node": "b9345daab52b4da2c83245d544f069425f8e82e1", "parents": ["7594e3326b88fee3becc02149343953ffaf84529"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790343774, "git_changesets": ["c9fc813254ade34aba9f7ce3103173a8cc2a0181", "fa9843d1963da8b5cece54ca6f509d537977c129", "49713b40ec21590e81f8dbd7275b874a340052f9"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28682": {"changesets": [{"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074872 - Key WebRender render target FBOs by a unique id, not the GL texture name  a=diannaS\n\nOn a lost context glGenTextures returns 0 for every new texture, so render\ntargets created before the device reset is handled collided in\nGlDevice::render_targets and tripped its duplicate-insert assert. Give each\nTexture a never-reused target id and use that as the key, as the FBOs were per\ntexture before they moved into the GL backend.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328641\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329102\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/device/gl.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/device/types.rs"], "git_node": "606c179a66adbcd21a44bb9945032dae73ac4a66", "git_parents": ["49713b40ec21590e81f8dbd7275b874a340052f9"], "node": "5774fe77cdc04af9b9c35d855b4898eda66a5e21", "parents": ["b9345daab52b4da2c83245d544f069425f8e82e1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790345156, "git_changesets": ["606c179a66adbcd21a44bb9945032dae73ac4a66"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28683": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074783 - Ensure PathRecording::MoveToBuilder calls ResetCachedState on the path.  a=diannaS\n\nPathRecording::MoveToBuilder did not always call ResetCachedState, so it allowed the old mapping of the\npath to stay alive in an event recorder, even as the path was being reused inside the new PathBuilderRecording.\nResetCachedState just needs to be called in the other branch that does not call the actual PathBuilderRecording\nconstructor, so the path's identity is now effectively reset.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328715\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329035\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/PathRecording.cpp"], "git_node": "a62d54b5cc497141b75c4443509f2ac555317627", "git_parents": ["606c179a66adbcd21a44bb9945032dae73ac4a66"], "node": "f14d4a2acb583a4a8474e213c32010fe115e7373", "parents": ["5774fe77cdc04af9b9c35d855b4898eda66a5e21"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790345220, "git_changesets": ["a62d54b5cc497141b75c4443509f2ac555317627"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28684": {"changesets": [{"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075275 - New tab search bar variant A experiment: darken button in dark mode to improve contrast.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328872\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329094\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/urlbar.css"], "git_node": "f36c9e91d31147f1d4dd8be60d3f90c264d068c3", "git_parents": ["a62d54b5cc497141b75c4443509f2ac555317627"], "node": "8159930716368b783d4ac271c07814bf08dadc0e", "parents": ["f14d4a2acb583a4a8474e213c32010fe115e7373"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790348626, "git_changesets": ["f36c9e91d31147f1d4dd8be60d3f90c264d068c3"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28685": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mark Striemer \u003cmstriemer@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074566 - Keep moz-input focus rings tight to the border  a=diannaS\n\nIn bug 2060287 the focus outline colour of the text inputs was corrected\nby using our default focus outline, but we actually don't want the\noffset for text inputs. This keeps the HCM fix but reverts pushing the\nfocus outline away from the input.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328933\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329210\n", "files": ["toolkit/content/tests/widgets/test_moz_input_text.html", "toolkit/content/widgets/moz-input-text/moz-input-text.css"], "git_node": "6fd7bf0ebab59928b3381e7c0ed987af123bb367", "git_parents": ["f36c9e91d31147f1d4dd8be60d3f90c264d068c3"], "node": "4546d8e5f80f95a4cd4ccd00705cee9902d5218f", "parents": ["8159930716368b783d4ac271c07814bf08dadc0e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790351849, "git_changesets": ["6fd7bf0ebab59928b3381e7c0ed987af123bb367"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28686": {"changesets": [{"author": "Noah Bond \u003cnbond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068594 - Update the tab counter icons to the latest design  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328907\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329226\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/ui/icons/src/main/res/drawable/mozac_ic_infinite_tabs_24.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/ui/icons/src/main/res/drawable/mozac_ic_tab_24.xml"], "git_node": "c37b87849334cf3452dffad1396b8a0f9eaa09bc", "git_parents": ["6fd7bf0ebab59928b3381e7c0ed987af123bb367"], "node": "edcbf53f6a2c96d0362ae16ab341d3b169ddaeb8", "parents": ["4546d8e5f80f95a4cd4ccd00705cee9902d5218f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790358481, "git_changesets": ["c37b87849334cf3452dffad1396b8a0f9eaa09bc"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28687": {"changesets": [{"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074892: Revert over-aggressive assertion  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328610\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329233\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/wasm/regress/bug2074892.js", "js/src/jit/MIR.cpp"], "git_node": "6f7a788b73e5543b17cf2a241f04a0c733e62532", "git_parents": ["c37b87849334cf3452dffad1396b8a0f9eaa09bc"], "node": "9e48726e10c1677a19405b182e6c7a1bc2ad1ca5", "parents": ["edcbf53f6a2c96d0362ae16ab341d3b169ddaeb8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790358979, "git_changesets": ["6f7a788b73e5543b17cf2a241f04a0c733e62532"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28688": {"changesets": [{"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069666: Let a tab detached from a fullscreen window choose its own position.  a=diannaS\n\nSince bug 2051071 the new window no longer enters fullscreen on its initial show, which made the position we pass along for it visible: `left` and `top` are clamped to leave room for a window as large as the one the tab is dragged from, and a fullscreen window covers the screen, so they collapse onto the corner of the available screen rect and the new window opens in that corner, on top of the fullscreen window.\n\nThe new window doesn't take our size either, since bug 1946016 stopped passing outerWidth and outerHeight along on macOS, so there is no drop position left to compute for it.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327658\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329313\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/content/drag-and-drop.js", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser.toml", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_detach_fullscreen.js"], "git_node": "539af925eebc21a7d98950a84b5cf5fe75a378e5", "git_parents": ["6f7a788b73e5543b17cf2a241f04a0c733e62532"], "node": "26b39cfd93cf765b51dbad5d21e72da73cd35ebd", "parents": ["9e48726e10c1677a19405b182e6c7a1bc2ad1ca5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790370091, "git_changesets": ["539af925eebc21a7d98950a84b5cf5fe75a378e5"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28689": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Shin \u003cdshin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068441: Make browsing context under printing browsing context not targetable.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327854\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329195\n", "files": ["docshell/base/BrowsingContext.cpp", "dom/base/crashtests/2068441.html", "dom/base/crashtests/crashtests.list"], "git_node": "59832e6de8369f6f5e78eeb1dd537258885999ac", "git_parents": ["539af925eebc21a7d98950a84b5cf5fe75a378e5"], "node": "75ab45d89cd1c4525da9c1a311d25eb03293a0da", "parents": ["26b39cfd93cf765b51dbad5d21e72da73cd35ebd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790370135, "git_changesets": ["59832e6de8369f6f5e78eeb1dd537258885999ac"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28690": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from main\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-hy-rAM/strings.xml", "mobile/android/androi