h accelerated filters.  a=diannaS\n\nWhen an identity color matrix is supplied, this may generate a filter sequence of premul-crop-unpremul\ninstead of the expected premul-crop-colormatrix-unpremul. This caused a fallback to a software filter\nthat failed to read back from an A8 accelerated textures.\n\nThis fixes the A8 readback to work and plumbs the necessary pathway through FilterNodeWebgl::Draw to\navoid the fallback.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328744\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329300\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/DrawTargetWebgl.cpp", "dom/canvas/FilterNodeWebgl.cpp", "dom/canvas/FilterNodeWebgl.h", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/2074107-1-ref.html", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/2074107-1.html", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/reftest.list"], "git_node": "5a6fce8be7645a9e289f1c94075aaf4dbceb0d32", "git_parents": ["7a8381ab9251caa17a35cd377074b49804b9f3de"], "node": "ecf2fe5346596c8f0ec44c03aba19e96187723c7", "parents": ["a2184f79f9ea72ad6e2f4c30489ff19ad2c1df1a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790427227, "git_changesets": ["5a6fce8be7645a9e289f1c94075aaf4dbceb0d32"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "28694": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from main\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-el/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-es-rMX/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-es-rMX/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rMX/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ka/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml"], "git_node": "5d70d3